  "bio": "Chicken Suprême is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Bourges, France, who specializes in illustrative and anime-style tattoos. Their work is a vibrant homage to manga and pop-culture, often characterized by its maximalist approach that captures the essence of their unique artistic voice. Renowned for their proficiency and attention to detail, Chicken Suprême's tattoos are true masterpieces that can turn skin into a canvas of colorful storytelling.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Bourges, Centre-val De Loire, France"
